f her body are white from her elbows and knees, her elbows are fluffy, her chest and crotch are handsome, and her belly is \u2664-shaped from her belly button, which is connected to the pattern on her back.\n\nThe long hairs on the face are like a long tuft extending from the base of the lower jaw after the cheek hairs are ruffled a little around the face.\nThe antennae are two long, slightly dark light blue hairs extending from the base of the chin, and two dark blue hairs extending from the hair, with a red gradation when excited or shy.\nShe has a mysterious, cold, strong-eyed, wild and expressionless face, but when she is relaxed, she shows a soft and dignified face like her mother!\nThat's all.\n\nI like the sister drawn by Komimi, and I look forward to working with her!\n\nHere is a summary image.\nhttps://x.com/fo_wo7/status/1633456205292273665?s=46&t=RkLfH7-maF9cpFJWI9EL8g\n\nhttps://x.com/drawing_lovo/status/1601241226157916162?s=46&t=RkLfH7-maF9cpFJWI9EL8g\n\nhttps://x.com/fo_wo7/status/1715013298188665279?s=46&t=RkLfH7-maF9cpFJWI9EL8g", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko_mimizuku/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1708679, "client_id": 2008635, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce0e6cf23f02a732ae4a70c7db80276d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce0e6cf23f02a732ae4a70c7db80276d, https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a8383dc47e9af60040b63b3e1506f5e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b0df444db94b877a95e07326c93d4ac 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ccf0ff9896e308c879216a7205913fac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ccf0ff9896e308c879216a7205913fac, https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0079fb8bb16d32d4513b4fbeeaedb696 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2644bb9/uploads/origins/130b5613-e846-4607-99aa-b15b28eb3fc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dffca3908a9172f75a68f41f92aa4342 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would love for you to draw my furry friend here, a they/themself named Gibby! I linked a site with many images to use as references.\nI'd love to work with you further if this goes well and give a bonus if this piece finishes exceptionally good!\nI know you have your style- draw this fellow the way you think looks best! Maybe being cute and flustered and blushing, or being working hard with science stuff!\nExcited to hear from you!\n\u00a0https://toyhou.se/24562168.gibby/gallery", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko_mimizuku/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1708679, "client_id": 584710, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a369c0c9/uploads/origins/83cdc7d6-1826-470b-8e5d-245defb8b100?bg=%23fff&auto=format